---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Bidwell Capital" description="Bidwell Capital is a relationship-driven private investment firm focused on building generational wealth through cash-flowing real assets.">
  <section class="hero-sm">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label fade-up fade-up-1">About</span>
      <h1 class="fade-up fade-up-2">Building generational wealth through cash-flowing assets.</h1>
      <p class="fade-up fade-up-3">Bidwell Capital was built on a simple belief: durable wealth is created through productive assets, patient ownership, and disciplined execution. We focus on cash-flowing investments where operational insight, tax efficiency, and long-standing relationships can create meaningful long-term value.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Company / What we do -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="section-label">What we do</span>
          <h2>A relationship-driven investment firm.</h2>
          <p>Bidwell Capital partners with investors to build long-term wealth through productive real assets. We work in three verticals: cash-flowing real estate, oil and gas, and private credit. Each is centered on income, disciplined underwriting, and an operator we have built trust with over time.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">We are not interested in chasing every market cycle or promoting every trending asset class. We do not raise capital for operators we do not know personally. Our focus is narrower by design: cash-flowing assets, trusted partners, thoughtful underwriting, and long-term stewardship.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-side">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Operator-led</h3>
            <p>We have run the businesses behind the assets we invest in. That experience shapes our underwriting and what we ask of our partners.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <h3>Income-first</h3>
            <p>We prefer assets that produce income today while supporting long-term wealth creation. Appreciation is welcome, never assumed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <h3>Long-term horizon</h3>
            <p>We build for decades, not deal cycles. Capital is treated as a long-term responsibility, not a one-time transaction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">What guides us</span>
      <h2>Our values are how we make decisions.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">These are the principles we keep returning to when we evaluate an asset, a partner, or a structure.</p>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Stewardship</h3>
          <p>We treat investor capital as a long-term responsibility. Communication, reporting, and decisions all flow from that.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Discipline</h3>
          <p>We underwrite for downside first. Conservative assumptions, stress-tested cases, and clear-eyed views of how a thesis can fail.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Alignment</h3>
          <p>We invest alongside our partners and structure for alignment with the investors who come in with us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Relationships</h3>
          <p>The operator is the deal. We work behind people we know and have been in business with over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Transparency</h3>
          <p>Clear underwriting, plain-language reporting, and direct access to the team. No spreadsheet theater.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Patience</h3>
          <p>Durable wealth takes time. We are willing to wait for the right opportunities, with the right partners, at the right structure.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Founder</span>
      <div class="founder-grid">
        <div class="founder-photo">
          <img src="/photos/adam-penn.jpg" alt="Adam Penn, Founder of Bidwell Capital" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="founder-bio">
          <h2>Adam Penn</h2>
          <p>Adam Penn began investing in 2017 and has spent nearly a decade building and operating businesses around real assets. His background in software engineering shaped a systems-first approach to investing, one focused on process, data, operations, and long-term durability.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">His experience across real estate, short-term rental operations, private credit, and energy investments shapes Bidwell Capital's practical, operator-led investment philosophy. He is based in Northern California and co-hosts the <a href="https://www.wealthindependencepod.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wealth Independence Podcast</a>.</p>
          <p class="disclaimer" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">Bidwell Capital also draws on relationships with experienced operators and mentors across real estate and energy. Those relationships inform our work but do not represent direct experience of Bidwell Capital itself.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container cta-wrap">
      <span class="section-label">Next step</span>
      <h2>Connect with us.</h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">If our approach resonates, we would like to learn about your goals.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 1.75rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Connect With Us</a>
        <a href="/philosophy" class="btn btn-outline">View Investment Philosophy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-sm {
    padding: 5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .hero-sm h1 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .hero-sm p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .section-tint {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .founder-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 280px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .founder-bio h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-wrap {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .cta-wrap h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
  }

  .cta-sub {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    max-width: 50ch;
  }
</style>
